        "TileImage": "$($repository 63ce19e1-3956-46d1-8979-62f939ffefa6).Image",
        "Description": "Good afternoon 47. Your target is Levi Akerman, explosives engineer contracted by Kronstadt. He used to work for the US army, inventing a type of explosive cheaper than the explosives they used at the time. It was already known the train was derailed using explosives. But in a letter to a man known as &quot;The Explosives Expert.&quot; It&apos;s revealed they used that type of explosives. But they were anounced april 11th 2003. But this happened in april 8th. I&apos;m sure you can peice it together. Good luck 47.",
